# Stable spec ID: difford-tommys-margarita. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(tequila; reposado, 100% agave) 2 fl oz
(lime: juice, fresh) 1 fl oz
(agave syrup) 1/2 fl oz
Optional [
  (bitters @ Difford's Margarita Bitters) 4 drops
]

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(mesh strainer)
(rocks glass)

::instructions
<shake, measured ingredients with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
<fine-strain, into a chilled (rocks glass, filled with ice)>
<garnish, with a lime wedge>

